     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Contrasts",
     "texto": [
      "**Sz** is pronounced further back than **ś**; **cz** and **ć** are also different. The letters **si** before another vowel usually stand for the soft sound **ś**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Listening",
     "texto": [
      "Don't add an extra vowel between the consonants, like an «uh» sound. Repeat slowly and notice whether the sound is soft or hard."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
